ID: vr-34
Title: Full-model emotion controls and bounded gallery definition

GitHub issue: https://github.com/Zanark/Verona/issues/33

Status: DONE
Milestone: Source-grounded full emotion inventory and proposed FaceMesh GIF scope.
Dependencies: vr-33

Purpose:
The owner likes bright spokes/glowing centers and4x emotions, requests all
emotions/combinations, then explicitly chooses to explore the model's extra
controls before defining the gallery. Research first; do not silently scope
the full model to the four emotions currently exposed by Verona.

Tasks:
[x] Read pinned Claire metadata and SDK conditioning/accumulation mechanisms.
[x] Probe all ten controls and bounded blends locally without changing runtime.
[x] Distinguish explicit emotions, implicit style, neutral and continuous weights.
[x] Define a finite gallery, its strengths, comparison settings and limits.
[x] Reconcile book/index/ledger/tracking/owned continuity and research delivery.

Acceptance criteria:
Exact names/channel order grounded in pinned model metadata and actual tensor
shape. Current app's four emotions distinguished from ten model controls.
Preserve model/assets, application defaults, old media and user/sibling apps.
No new dependency, cloud inference, user recording or camera/microphone.
Probe records exact frames, conditioning policy, finite/packing checks and
limitations; no numerical output described as visual or semantic acceptance.
Gallery uses the owner's chosen bright spokes/glowing center and4x, fixed
voice/phrase/camera/timestamps; any finite subset or normalization policy is
explicitly a sampling choice, not every possible weighted expression.
Do not implement production controls or generate an unbounded gallery under
the research choice. No release, deployment or finished book edition.

Completion evidence:
Pinned network_info.json declares sixteen implicit values and ten explicit
controls: amazement, anger, cheekiness, disgust, fear, grief, joy, outofbreath,
pain, sadness. Existing expression_condition exposes only four plus neutral.
SDK copies explicit vectors after the implicit values; accumulator stores
time-keyed vectors. Actual model input26values =16implicit +10explicit.
57four-frame CPU cases: neutral/10singles/45pairs/1tenway, totalstrength0.6,
gain4, fixedaudio/style and frames12/28/44/60. All finite/Int16-packable with
57distinct packed outputs. Singlemax sampled displacements0.733..3.682cm,
pair joint-vs-average coefficient residual0.0120..0.3547. Not fullclip or
visual/semantic acceptance. No runtime/default/model/media changes.
Propose56GIFs neutral+10singles+45pairs, equaldivisionof0.6total, brightspokes/
glowingcenters/4x/samevoicephrasecamera/timestamps. Complete equal-subset
sampling would be1024includingneutral; continuous blends remain unlimited.
Chapter09/source register/brief/index distinguish proposed from implemented.
Research findings and the finite sampling proposal are complete; gallery
size selection, production implementation and capture are not this milestone.
Source publication is established separately by Git history.

